  "goodToKnow": "Die Hautfarbe is skin colour: Menschen jeder Hautfarbe. Discrimination on grounds of ethnic origin is prohibited by the General Equal Treatment Act (AGG) and Article 3 of the Grundgesetz. In recent years, crayons and plasters once labelled hautfarben (skin-coloured, meaning pale pink-beige) have been relabelled, since skin comes in many colours. Die Haut is skin: mit Haut und Haaren (completely). Plural: die Hautfarben."
